Package: io.github.phase1geo.annotator
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Image annotation tool
 Annotate images with shapes, stickers, text, drawings, callouts,
 magnifiers and blur. Supports crop, resize, borders, unlimited
 undo/redo and export to JPEG, PNG, TIFF, BMP, PDF, SVG and WebP.
